# inc-4999 phase 3: load a frozen caster fixture, descend to depth 2, genocide
# everything, and take one full rest with NO Learn Spell menu change. Read by
# tools/check_rest_per_source.sh cases a (Priest/Mage) and c (Bard). Both frozen
# fixtures were saved IN wizard mode, so `w` opens the wizard menu at once: this
# script has no `y` (an orc fixture saved outside wizard mode needs `w y`).
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/<name>.sav \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/rest-per-source-restonly.keys 1
#
# THE ROUTE. Player::Rest refuses depth 1 ("you can just climb back out of the
# dungeon entirely") and refuses while a hostile is in plain sight, so this
# descends to depth 2 (wizard mode) and genocides everything first -- the same
# route tools/keys/mage-loadout-rest.keys uses. INCURSION_SPELLFLAG_PROBE=1
# makes the load and the rest each log SPELLFLAG_PROBE lines to
# logs/errors.log; the check reads both.
#
# 'z' MUST BE LOWERCASE: KY_CMD_SLEEP is { 'Z', 0 } and the keyset compares
# modifier flags exactly, so a shifted 'Z' matches nothing (src/KeyScript.cpp).

s                       # one real turn: this counts as a session (exit 5 otherwise)
w                       # wizard menu (already in wizard mode)
@choose "Ascend / Descend Depth"
"2" ENTER
@until "HP:" ESC
w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
@until "HP:" ESC

@dump:before-rest
z
y
@dump:after-rest
@dump:end
